        "description": "USN-5328-1 fixed a vulnerability in OpenSSL. This update provides the corresponding update for Ubuntu 14.04 ESM and Ubuntu 16.04 ESM.  Original advisory details:   Tavis Ormandy discovered that OpenSSL incorrectly parsed certain  certificates. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause  OpenSSH to stop responding, resulting in a denial of service.",
